   ],
   "spoken": "After d5 and Nc3 it's a Jobava London — and Nc3 carries a hidden cost: it makes the pawn on d4 chronically weak, which becomes our target.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Nc3 in a Queen's-Pawn setup weakens d4; pressure it with c5."
